      "message": "wallet: rpc: Deprecate `encryptwallet`\n\nEncrypting wallets from creation will still be supported, but there are\nfootguns both for users and for developers in supporting wallets that\nare created unencrypted and then later become encrypted.\n\nThe functional tests where the `deprecatedrpc` argument is added are\nones where functionality or behavior of `encryptwallet` is being tested,\nthey should be kept until the RPC command is removed.",
